## Grafana

The apps send their traces, metrics and logs to Grafana on the platform's
network; the server sends its CPU, memory, disk and network.
{{- with index (optionsOf "observability") "grafana_domain"}} Grafana
answers on https://{{.}}{{end}}{{if not (index (optionsOf "observability") "grafana_domain")}} `task grafana`
opens it at http://localhost:3000, through SSH{{end}}: sign in as `admin`
with `grafana_password` (`task secrets:edit`).
